byid['CL-SA19-222']['fate']+=' A precise later analogue is Suzuki2024 Proposition11.10, pp.500–501: the p-primary component pairing agrees with the intersection discriminant pairing for complete normal two-dimensional local rings of mixed characteristic(0,p) with perfect residue field; its full proof and Proposition11.2 were read. This differs from the coefficient-field/equal-characteristic setup of BrauerIII8.4, so no unproved transfer between hypotheses is claimed.'
