byid['CL-SA19-258']['fate']='Directly read Hartshorne1966, Residues and Duality II Proposition7.17 pp.131–132 and its proof, Theorem7.18 p.133 and its proof, with Lemma7.16 and Corollaries7.9–7.14. These exactly prove the locally-noetherian quasi-coherent decomposition and all-module injectivity criterion. Earlier Gabriel1962 IV§2Theorem2 and VI§2Theorem1 establish the noetherian QCoh decomposition; their category convention alone does not supply all-module injectivity. Lunts–Schnürer2016Theorem2.1 gives the precise modern preservation statement. The reused fragment’s mathematical lineage is identified, but its exact prepublication typescript provenance remains unproved.'
